WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.380
Behold: a leaky roof, and a past

2
00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.207
Essay topic from 2022.

3
00:00:05.207 --> 00:00:08.240
The time to repair the roof is

4
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.340
when the sun is shining.

5
00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:12.740
Meher and Arun, two made up

6
00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.400
friends, will build both sides

7
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.770
over tea.

8
00:00:16.557 --> 00:00:18.537
Repair it while you can afford

9
00:00:18.537 --> 00:00:22.017
to. Storms send no notice, and a

10
00:00:22.017 --> 00:00:24.257
crisis makes every fix cost

11
00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:25.087
more.

12
00:00:25.557 --> 00:00:27.297
Other needs are loudest in

13
00:00:27.297 --> 00:00:28.497
sunshine too.

14
00:00:28.497 --> 00:00:30.357
Money for a roof that may never

15
00:00:30.357 --> 00:00:32.137
leak is not spent on a need

16
00:00:32.137 --> 00:00:33.367
already here.

17
00:00:33.759 --> 00:00:35.519
Prevention is cheaper than

18
00:00:35.519 --> 00:00:38.679
rescue. A small patch in the sun

19
00:00:38.679 --> 00:00:40.579
beats a new ceiling after the

20
00:00:40.579 --> 00:00:42.829
