21
00:00:43.351 --> 00:00:45.491
Nobody can mend every roof.

22
00:00:45.491 --> 00:00:47.631
Without a leak to show, it is

23
00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:49.591
hard to say which repair matters

24
00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:50.391
most.

25
00:00:50.824 --> 00:00:53.584
Good days leave room to plan, to

26
00:00:53.584 --> 00:00:56.044
compare costs, and to listen to

27
00:00:56.044 --> 00:00:58.684
engineers. In the middle of a

28
00:00:58.684 --> 00:01:01.414
