29
00:01:01.637 --> 00:01:03.417
A plan made for sunny weather

30
00:01:03.417 --> 00:01:05.097
can be wrong for the storm that

31
00:01:05.097 --> 00:01:07.037
comes. Preparing for the wrong

32
00:01:07.037 --> 00:01:08.727
weather is waste too.

33
00:01:09.124 --> 00:01:11.034
How to build both sides.

34
00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:15.204
First, state the claim fairly.

35
00:01:15.204 --> 00:01:17.684
Second, give each side its best

36
00:01:17.684 --> 00:01:20.384
case. Third, find where they

37
00:01:20.384 --> 00:01:23.304
agree. Fourth, offer a balanced

38
00:01:23.304 --> 00:01:24.514
way forward.

39
00:01:25.737 --> 00:01:26.717
For the essay:

40
00:01:26.717 --> 00:01:29.077
build the other side before you

41
00:01:29.077 --> 00:01:30.077
build your own.

42
00:01:30.077 --> 00:01:32.807
Then a balanced way forward.

43
00:01:33.429 --> 00:01:35.209
The tea went cold.

44
00:01:35.209 --> 00:01:38.309
The roof held, heroically, and

45
00:01:38.309 --> 00:01:39.139
for now.
